The marked subsection “A singular integral need not satisfy monotone convergence” in Singular values and the Dixmier trace is adapted from Steven Lord and Fedor Sukochev, Measure Theory in Noncommutative Spaces, arXiv:1009.3095v1 (16 September 2010), Introduction following (1.6). That whole subsection, its proof and AI changes retain CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 Unported: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/. Attribution, noncommercial use, share-alike for adaptations/translations and the change notice are required. The complete legal code is dependencies/Lord-Sukochev/LICENSE. The adaptation is visibly delimited from the pre-existing CC0 contributions; it is separate from the analytic prerequisite proofs. Its exact scope and changes are recorded in source-notes.json. No author endorsement is implied.
